/pull/102880#issuecomment-2664256799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102880","id":2664256799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ezVUf","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-18T00:06:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T00:06:01Z","body":"Changed back to draft. I'd like to understand this better. \r\n\r\nI don't think outline makes sense for SVGs. Outline uses FT_LOAD_NO_BITMAP which results in a format of FT_GLYPH_FORMAT_OUTLINE and not FT_GLYPH_FORMAT_SVG so fix_alpha_edges won't run.\r\n\r\nfont_get_glyph_texture_rid and font_get_glyph_texture_size seem to used in 3d (Label3D) and I've only tested 2d so far.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2664256799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2666871821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102880#issuecomment-2666871821","is